                "value": "2024-01-01",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "ISO 8601 date. When combined with `end_date`, returns all time off records that overlap the `[start_date, end_date]` window — including records that only partially overlap at either boundary. When used alone, returns records whose `start_date` is on or after this date.\n"
